## Critical zone

Files and actions below have direct, real-world consequences (money, customers, live services).
**No agent changes them without the owner's approval, at any urgency:**
- {{path/to/live_execution/**}}
- {{path/to/risk_limits_config/**}}
- {{service control: start/stop/restart of live services}}

When a downstream agent needs that approval, quote the owner's own words and timestamp,
as typed in this session, inside the instruction. A decision relayed between agents is not
approval for anything external or irreversible.

